# Generated sample corpus. Not checked in: Claude Code names each log directory
# after the project's absolute path, so the fixture only joins to its repos at
# the path it was generated for. Rebuild with `npm run fixtures`.
fixtures/

# OS files
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Agent-harness state. These are the operator's own working files — an agent
# instruction file, an open-work roadmap, a decision log, and whatever
# .claude/ accumulates (plans, local settings, worktrees). They are written for
# one person's harness, and a plan file left in .claude/plans/ carries an
# execution contract a contributor's agent may try to run against their own
# checkout. Kept on disk, out of the published tree.
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
ROADMAP.md
DECISIONS.md

# Editor / IDE local state
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
